      "writtenOn": "2023-02-24T06:40:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For these tests, spec requires IUT to start with Stream mode. Test will verify if IUT is able to fall back to ERTM when peer rejects Stream and proposes ERTM .\n\nI didn\u0027t find any way in upper layer to adjust the default fcr mode, so I implemented an API in [1].\n\nThe original code here was very confusing to me because `L2CAP_FCR_BASIC_MODE` is defined as 0 so the condition is never satisfied.\n\nWhile reading the code, I believe that l2cap implementation was mostly based on an assumption that we only support basic and ertm, which makes it hard to pass some PTS tests.\n\n[1]https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/2319752",
      "parentUuid": "0ff511ce_3f7e8648",
      "revId": "a67ef83da1a53cb50c84a633631fe0601e26c9a4",
